<div class="about-wrapper">


<div class="about-content">


<h1>
{{ page.title }}
</h1>


<h2>
Welcome to AGESSENTIAL
</h2>


<p>
We are passionate about bringing happiness, creativity, and learning to children through our wide range of quality toys and stationery products.
</p>


<p>
From fun toys that inspire imagination to school supplies that support learning, we carefully select products that are safe, useful, and loved by kids of all ages.
</p>


<p>
Our goal is to provide parents and children with a trusted place where they can find amazing toys, educational products, and everyday stationery essentials at affordable prices.
</p>



<div class="about-boxes">


<div class="box">

<h3>
🎮 Toys Collection
</h3>

<p>
Explore exciting toys designed for creativity, fun, and endless playtime.
</p>

</div>



<div class="box">

<h3>
✏️ Stationery Collection
</h3>

<p>
Discover school and office stationery products with great quality and style.
</p>

</div>



<div class="box">

<h3>
⭐ Our Promise
</h3>

<p>
Quality products, friendly service, and customer satisfaction are our priorities.
</p>

</div>


</div>


</div>



<div class="about-image">


